  "title": "Dark Blue Parfum Intense 100ml",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><p>An elegant and unexpected harmony around a quartet of Italian mandarin, stunning osmanthus, sweet immortelle and saffron.</p>\n<p>Osmanthus, the iconic flower of China and Italian Mandarin brings intense brightness and vivacity. Immortelle adds sublime balance, using salty and mineralic tones to act as a striking harmony. The saffron note at the heart of the fragrance become softer, gaining lightness and gentleness in contact with the fragrance of violet. A olfactory harmony both delicate and balanced, full of energy, sensuality, and contrast, Dark Blue is quite unlike any fragrance.</p>\n</div>",
